 BVDI_BAItemVerifiedPurchaser\"><div id=\"BVDI_BAPopup_b6ww3ji2ww019ybhcb643af40_ID\" class=\"BVDIPopup BVDI_BAPopup BVDI_BAPopupVerifiedPurchaser\" style=\"display: none;\"><div class=\"BVDIInside BVDI_BAInsidePopup\"><div class=\"BVDIBody BVDI_BAPopupBody\"><dl class=\"BVDI_BAList\"><dt class=\"BVDI_BAItem BVDI_BAItemOnly BVDI_BAItemVerifiedPurchaser\">\n<a onclick=\"return false;\" class=\"BVDILink BVDILinkDisabled\"> <span class=\"BVDILinkSpan\">Verified Purchaser<\/span><\/a><\/dt><dd><p>Customer has been confirmed to have purchased the item from Walmart.<\/p><\/dd><\/dl><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n<a onclick=\"return false;\" class=\"BVDILink BVDILinkDisabled\" id=\"BVDI_BABadge_b0uv75foqvrwo2x4sjzl0re2s_ID\"onmouseover=\"bvTooltip.show(&quot;BVDI_BAPopup_b6ww3ji2ww019ybhcb643af40_ID&quot;, this.id, false, []);\"onmouseout=\"bvTooltip.hide();\"> <span class=\"BVDILinkSpan\">Verified Purchaser<\/span><\/a><\/li><\/ul><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n <div class=\"BVRRCustomUserInfoContainer\">\n<div class=\"BVRRContextDataContainer\"><\/div> <\/div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3Main\">\n <div class=\"BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3MainSpacer BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3MainSpacerTop\"><\/div>\n\n<div class=\"BVRRReviewRatingsContainer\"> <div class=\"BVRROverallRatingContainer\" >\n<div class=\"BVRRRatingContainerStar\"><div class=\"BVRRRatingEntry BVRROdd\"><div id=\"BVRRRatingOverall_Review_Display\" class=\"BVRRRating BVRRRatingNormal BVRRRatingOverall\"><div class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRRatingNormalLabel\"><\/div><div class=\"BVRRRatingNormalImage\">\n<div class=\"BVImgOrSprite\" style=\"width:75px;height:15px;overflow:hidden\"><img src=\"https://walmart.ugc.bazaarvoice.com/1336/5_0/9/rating.png\" alt=\"5 out of 5\" title=\"5 out of 5\" width=\"135\" height=\"15\" />\n<\/div><\/div>\n<div itemprop=\"reviewRating\" itemscope itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Rating\" class=\"BVRRRatingNormalOutOf\"> <span itemprop=\"ratingValue\" class=\"BVRRNumber BVRRRatingNumber\">5<\/span>\n <span class=\"BVRRSeparatorText\">out of<\/span>\n <span itemprop=\"bestRating\" class=\"BVRRNumber BVRRRatingRangeNumber\">5<\/span>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div> <\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"BVRRReviewTitleContainer\"><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRReviewTitlePrefix\"><\/span><span itemprop=\"name\" class=\"BVRRValue BVRRReviewTitle\">Highly recommend!<\/span><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRReviewTitleSuffix\">, <\/span><\/div>\n<div class=\"BVRRReviewDateContainer\"><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRReviewDatePrefix\"><\/span><span class=\"BVRRValue BVRRReviewDate\">07/08/2025<meta itemprop=\"datePublished\" content=\"2025-07-08\"/><\/span><span class=\"BVRRLabel BVRRReviewDateSuffix\"><\/span><\/div>\n<div class=\"BVRRReviewDisplayStyle3Content\">\n <div itemprop=\"description\" class=\"BVRRReviewTextContainer\" >\n\n\n\n\n<div id=\"BVRRReviewAbbreviatedText391195344_2bdp1hpkfexgx4baa09ip1ge7_ID\" class=\"BVRRReviewAbbreviatedText\"><div class=\"BVRRReviewAbbreviatedTextParagraph BVRRReviewAbbreviatedTextFirstParagraph\"> <span class=\"BVRRReviewAbbreviatedText\">Before buying, I did a ton of research \u2018cause I was tired of mowers wrecking my grass\u2014patchy spots, uneven cuts, you name it. Turns out, front-wheel drive models like this one are way gentler on the lawn, and this mower didn\u2019t disappoint.<\/span>\n<\/div><div class=\"BVRRReviewAbbreviatedTextParagraph BVRRReviewAbbreviatedTextLastParagraph\"> <span class=\"BVRRReviewAbbreviatedText\">It\u2019s got<\/span>\n<span class=\"BVRRReviewAbbreviatedTextSuffix\"><span class=\"BVDI_AbbreviatedLinkPrefix\">...<\/span><span class=\"BVDI_AbbreviatedLink\"><a onclick=\" if(window.BVAnalyticsTracker){BVAnalyticsTracker.fireActionEvent(this);};&#10;$bv('#BVRRReviewAbbreviatedText391195344_2bdp1hpkfexgx4baa09ip1ge7_ID').toggleClass('BVDIHidden');$bv('#BVRRReview391195344_hnd5za8a1g8toer860wzdm0f8_ID').toggleClass('BVDIHidden');bvStopPropagation(event);return false;\" name=\"BV_TrackingTag_Review_Display_ToggleReadMore\" href=\"#\" class=\"BVDILink \"><span class=\"BVDILinkSpan\">(read full review)<\/span><\/a><\/span><span class=\"BVDI_AbbreviatedLinkSuffix\"><\/span><\/span><\/div><\/div>\n<div id=\"BVRRReview391195344_hnd5za8a1g8toer860wzdm0f8_ID\" class=\"BVRRReviewText BVDIHidden\"><div class=\"BVRRReviewTextParagraph BVRRReviewTextFirstParagraph\"> <span class=\"BVRRReviewText\">Before buying, I did a ton of research \u2018cause I was tired of mowers wrecking my grass\u2014patchy spots, uneven cuts, you name it. Turns out, front-wheel drive models like this one are way gentler on the lawn, and this mower didn\u2019t disappoint.<\/span>\n<\/div><div class=\"BVRRReviewTextParagraph\"> <span class=\"BVRRReviewText\">It\u2019s got that floating cutting system which helps it glide over bumps without tearing up the grass.The grass looks super even and healthy now\u2014no more bald patches like I had before.<\/span>\n<\/div><div class=\"BVRRReviewTextParagraph BVRRReviewTextLastParagraph\"> <span class=\"BVRRReviewText\">Also, big shoutout to their customer service. When I first got it, I had trouble setting up the app and connecting the mower to Wi-Fi. I reached out to them, and they got back to me within a few hours with clear, easy instructions. Really made me feel like they actually care. Honestly, I\u2019m glad I did my homework\u2014this mower\u2019s made life easier!<\/span>\n<span class=\"BVRRReviewTextSuffix\"><span class=\"BVDI_FullLinkPrefix\"><\/span><span class=\"BVDI_FullLink\"><a onclick=\" if(window.BVAnalyticsTracker){BVAnalyticsTracker.fireActionEvent(this);};&#10;$bv('#BVRRReviewAbbreviatedText391195344_2bdp1hpkfexgx4baa09ip1ge7_ID').toggleClass('BVDIHidden');$bv('#BVRRReview391195344_hnd5za8a1g8toer860wzdm0f8_ID').toggleClass('BVDIHidden');bvStopPropagation(event);return false;\" name=\"BV_TrackingTag_Review_Display_ToggleReadMore\" href=\"#\" class=\"BVDILink \"><span class=\"BVDILinkSpan\">(hide full review)<\/span><\/a><\/span><span class=\"BVD